5. Client Script (onChange)
Requirement
When Category becomes Network
Make CI mandatory
Display Info Message
Script
function onChange(control, oldValue, newValue, isLoading) {

    if (isLoading || newValue == '') {
        return;
    }

    if (newValue == 'network') {

        g_form.setMandatory('cmdb_ci', true);

        g_form.addInfoMessage('Configuration Item is mandatory for Network category.');

    } else {

        g_form.setMandatory('cmdb_ci', false);

    }
}

6. GlideAggregate
